==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 4 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Cresselia ex Drop Event]], which ran from February 3 to 17, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Misdreavus|77}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*{{m|Confuse Ray}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Misdreavus}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

